        promptSnippet: "Request reviewed privileged commands through a dedicated herdr-app pane",
        promptGuidelines: [
            "When required work needs elevated privileges, proactively call sudo_task. Do not wait for user encouragement or ask the user to run sudo manually.",
            "Calling sudo_task only requests review; it never grants authorization. Keep commands minimal and exact, with a concrete reason for every step.",
            "Never run sudo through bash. Use sudo_task so Pi approval and separate herdr-app terminal consent remain mandatory.",
        ],
